{"tool_name":"emdatabank.org","contents":["oeb","biotools"],"fetched_metadata":{"biotools":{"id":"emdatabank.org","home":"http://EMDataBank.org","summary":"EMDataBank.org is a resource for deposition and retrieval of cryoEM maps, models and associated metadata. The resource unifies public access to the two major archives containing EM-based structural data: EM Data Bank (EMDB) and Protein Data Bank (PDB), and facilitates use of EM structural data of macromolecules and macromolecular complexes.","addition_date":"2017-03-27T12:32:27Z","last_update_date":"2018-12-10T12:58:56Z","tool_type":["Database portal"],"biotools_curie":"biotools:emdatabank.org","credit":[{"email":"help@emdatabank.org","name":"EMDataBank Support","typeEntity":"Person","typeRole":["Primary contact"]}],"edit_permission":{"type":"private"},"function":[{"operation":[{"term":"Data retrieval","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_2422"},{"term":"Deposition","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_3431"},{"term":"Mapping","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_2429"},{"term":"Protein modelling","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_0477"}]}],"name":"EMDataBank.org","operating_system":["Linux","Mac","Windows"],"owner":"ELIXIR-EE","publication":[{"metadata":{"abstract":"Cryo-electron microscopy reconstruction methods are uniquely able to reveal structures of many important macromolecules and macromolecular complexes. EMDataBank.org, a joint effort of the Protein Data Bank in Europe (PDBe), the Research Collaboratory for Structural Bioinformatics (RCSB) and the National Center for Macromolecular Imaging (NCMI), is a global 'one-stop shop' resource for deposition and retrieval of cryoEM maps, models and associated metadata. The resource unifies public access to the two major archives containing EM-based structural data: EM Data Bank (EMDB) and Protein Data Bank (PDB), and facilitates use of EM structural data of macromolecules and macromolecular complexes by the wider scientific community. \u00a9 Th